<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 18.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 18.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>			     Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		    Yield   Close</p>
<p> 1 Prime Credit Tr	 10.21   0.96</p>
<p> 2 Villa World	     10.00   1.10</p>
<p> 3 Indu Property	    9.89   0.92</p>
<p> 4 Prop Income Inv	  9.86   1.03</p>
<p> 5 BT Prop Trust	    9.66   1.69</p>
<p> 6 McIntosh Sec	     9.57   0.94</p>
<p> 7 Colonial Mutual	  9.12   1.16</p>
<p> 8 Aust Tour		  9.04   0.83</p>
